 "note": "Organs come from a different, post-menopausal donor (Visible Human Female, 59 y: uterus ~32 cm3, ovaries ~1 cm3, smaller than in reproductive age) and are placed in the MALE reference body (BodyParts3D). Positions are approximate: the pelvic organs were registered to the pelvic bones and then non-rigidly deformed (up to ~45% local compression) to fit between the male bladder and rectum; they still overlap the sigmoid colon/ileum loops and touch bladder/rectum by a few mm. The breasts (a sculpted HRA model, not imaging data) are positioned on the chest wall by rib landmarks and project beyond the male skin.",
